  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Celebrate retro sneakers of the past while looking forward in this contemporary take on the Nike Air Max 95\n\tMixed media leather and synthetic upper for comfort and durability\n\tSpringy PU foam midsole\n\tMax Air unit in the sole\n\tIconic Air Max 95 styling\n\tThe Nike Air Max 95 is imported.\n\n\nWhat's better than the heritage Nike Air Max 95? The modernized Toddler Nike Air Max 95 Casual Shoe, of course. Boasting the same Air Max 95 shape kids love dressed in premium materials, these sneakers honor the past while keeping their cool, on-trend style intact.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Kids' Toddler Nike Air Max 95 Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Kids'</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Toddler</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Pink Foam/White/Medium Grey</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3338592</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Toddler - Kids')</summary>\n  <div sty